<PageTitle>Koen Sakamoto and Dominik Jamrich's Snake Game</PageTitle>

<h1>Koen Sakamoto and Dominik Jamrich's Snake Game</h1>

Enter your name in the textbox on the snake page to get started (the name must be less than or equal to
    16 characters). If you are unable to connect, or at any time disconnect, an error message will appear on the screen
    and play will terminate. If you would like to stop playing, simply press the disconnect button. Before you can
try to reconnect you will have to close the error message by hitting the close button. Additional functionality include
usage of w,a,s,d keys and arrow keys; also powerup animation (where radius of powerup increases) when
eaten. Enjoy!